          },
          "well_done": {
            "id": "well_done",
            "text": "[The names stop for the second time.]\n— Relieved. —\n— I have four names I have not been able to say for four hundred years, because a guard on duty is not on the list. Listen. —\n— Corran. Ionna the elder. Meth. And the fourth would not give it, at the time, out of vanity, and I have kept the gap warm for her ever since. —\n[It says the gap. It is a silence exactly the length of a name.]\n— There. That is the whole job. That is all any of this has ever been. —",
